{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2023-04-12 10:00:00', 'title': 'ILLINOIS AMERICAN WATER & UNIVERSITY OF ILLINOIS EXTENSION OFFER TIPS FOR CLEAN WATER CONSERVATION IN FREE WEBINAR SERIES', 'text': 'URBANA, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WATER CONSERVATION IS A COMMON INTEREST FOR BOTH UNIVERSITY OF ILLINOIS EXTENSION AND ILLINOIS AMERICAN WATER, WHICH HAVE A MUTUAL GOAL OF EDUCATING PEOPLE ABOUT THIS VALUABLE RESOURCE. TO FURTHER THIS GOAL, ILLINOIS AMERICAN WATER IS SPONSORING THE CLEAN WATER CONSERVATION WEBINAR SERIES, FOUR 30-MINUTE ONLINE SESSIONS FOCUSING ON CONSERVATION TOPICS.'}